    "detailed_description": "Just draw anything. Make the ball move to the green zone!<br />\r\nIt is a puzzle game that can be your best brain teaser.<br />\r\nMBG is also good for teaching physics science to your own baby.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- How to play<br />\r\nYou can draw things by touching and dragging the screen. Your drawing will be dropping by gravity. Bump it to move the ball to the goal. Or you can make other construction as a tool to move the ball like ancient people.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n** Exit menu added. Thanks for the reply! **",
